 "Sookyung Pedia": [
  ["Clinic Receptionist", "Good afternoon! Dr. Lee's clinic, how may I help you?"],
  ["Soo", "Hi, good afternoon. This is Kyungsoo Do, dad ni Sookyung. Pwede po bang makausap si Doc Lee?"],
  ["Clinic Receptionist", "Hello, Sir Kyungsoo! Sandali lang po, check ko kung available si Doc."],
  ["Soo", "Sure, thank you."],
  ["Clinic Receptionist", "Sir, I'll transfer your call na lang po."],
  ["Soo", "Okay, thanks."],
  ["Dr. Lee", "Hello, Kyungsoo!"],
  ["Soo", "Hi, Doc. Good afternoon. Sorry, baka busy kayo."],
  ["Dr. Lee", "Okay lang! Kumusta? Si Sooky ba?"],
  ["Soo", "Okay naman po siya. Actually, tumawag lang ako kasi gusto ko sanang i-schedule yung routine checkup niya."],
  ["Dr. Lee", "Ah, oo nga. Parang ang tagal na rin since last visit niya. Five na siya, 'di ba?"],
  ["Soo", "Yes, Doc. Five going on fifteen, apparently."],
  ["Dr. Lee", "(Laughs) Ay, bakit naman?"],
  ["Soo", "Yesterday, sinabihan niya akong hindi raw bagay yung suot kong polo."],
  ["Dr. Lee", "(Laughs) May fashion consultant ka na pala sa bahay!"],
  ["Soo", "Unsolicited pa yung advice."],
  ["Dr. Lee", "(Chuckles) Naku. So, kailan mo gustong dalhin?"],
  ["Soo", "May available po ba kayong Saturday morning? Para hindi na siya aabsent sa school."],
  ["Dr. Lee", "Let me check... I think may slot pa around ten-thirty. Okay sa inyo?"],
  ["Soo", "Yes, perfect po."],
  ["Dr. Lee", "Sige. I'll have my secretary confirm. May concerns ka ba lately? Appetite, sleep, anything?"],
  ["Soo", "Wala namang major concerns. Okay yung appetite niya, although selective pa rin sa vegetables."],
  ["Dr. Lee", "Normal lang naman sa age niya. Basta continue offering different kinds, huwag pilitin."],
  ["Soo", "Yes, Doc. We're working on it. Negotiations are ongoing."],
  ["Dr. Lee", "(Laughs) Good luck diyan."],
  ["Soo", "Thank you. I'll need it."],
  ["Dr. Lee", "How about sleep? Nakaka-eight to ten hours naman?"],
  ["Soo", "Usually around ten. May nights lang na ayaw pang matulog kasi marami raw siyang important questions."],
  ["Dr. Lee", "Like what?"],
  ["Soo", "Last night, tinanong niya kung natutulog din daw yung mga isda."],
  ["Dr. Lee", "(Laughs) Very important nga naman."],
  ["Soo", "Apparently, kailangan niya ng sagot before bedtime."],
  ["Dr. Lee", "(Chuckles) At least curious siya. That's good."],
  ["Soo", "Also, Doc, may kailangan po ba kaming dalhin for the checkup? Yung vaccination record niya?"],
  ["Dr. Lee", "Yes, bring her vaccination booklet para ma-review natin kung may due na vaccines or boosters. We'll also check her height, weight, and general development."],
  ["Soo", "Okay po. I'll bring it."],
  ["Dr. Lee", "And tell Sooky I said hello. Baka maalala pa niya ako."],
  ["Soo", "Oh, she remembers you, Doc."],
  ["Dr. Lee", "Talaga?"],
  ["Soo", "You're the doctor with the dinosaur stickers."],
  ["Dr. Lee", "(Laughs) Ayun! At least memorable."],
  ["Soo", "She still has one on her water bottle."],
  ["Dr. Lee", "Naku, I'll prepare new ones for Saturday."],
  ["Soo", "Please don't tell her that in advance. Baka Friday pa lang, ready na siyang pumunta."],
  ["Dr. Lee", "(Laughs) Sige, surprise na lang."],
  ["Soo", "Alright, Doc. Thank you so much. See you Saturday."],
  ["Dr. Lee", "See you! Ingat kayo ni Sooky."],
  ["Soo", "Thank you, Doc. Bye."],
  ["Dr. Lee", "Bye!"]
 ],

